OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre trial sees 38k
OL,4,Abookings so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month since a council started a trial
OL,7,Fwhich means people have to book at some
OL,8,Fhousehold recycling centres (HRCs),
OL,9,Fthere have been 38,000 bookings.
OL,11,FWiltshire Council - which is running
OL,12,Fthe trial at six of its 10 HRCs - said
OL,13,Fabout 60% of bookings are being made on
OL,14,Fthe same day or the day before a visit.
OL,16,FResponses have been mixed, with some
OL,17,Fresidents saying it is "brilliant" and
OL,18,Fothers saying it has made disposing of
OL,19,Fwaste more complicated.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
