OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre trial sees 38k
OL,4,Abookings so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it wanted to improve
OL,7,Fqueuing and reduce any stress in what
OL,8,Fhad been a first-come-first-served
OL,9,Fsystem, and feedback would be taken on
OL,10,Fboard before any final decision is
OL,11,Fmade.
